        <mxCell id="p_filled" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;" value="State: &lt;b&gt;Filled&lt;/b&gt;. Count the spend in the budget NOW (not at HR approval). Count one refill for fairness.&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Budget below 0 (only if an admin lowered it)? Tell the contact &quot;over budget&quot;.&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
