        <mxCell id="side" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;spacing=8;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;Any time (outside the flow)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Admin&lt;/b&gt; (Lars / Deepa) types &quot;set budget oslo 7000 300 1200&quot; or &quot;set timer accept 45&quot;: checked, applies at once. Anyone else is refused.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&quot;away 3&quot;&lt;/b&gt;: that person is skipped for 3 days.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Report&lt;/b&gt;: per office in its own currency, one combined total, snacks counted, every purchase listed.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Visitors&lt;/b&gt;: asked in the office they are visiting, spending counts there.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Office hours&lt;/b&gt;: if an office closes while someone is being asked, the refill goes to &lt;b&gt;Waiting&lt;/b&gt; and carries on at 10:00." vertex="1">
